1 Function Declaration	Standard reusable functions	Login, setup, utils
2️⃣	Arrow Function (=>)	Short, clean, no this, used in utility/helper logic	map, filter, test helpers
3️⃣	Async Function	Needed for await in Playwright	Every Playwright test step
